  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **The Legend of Chavo Guerrero**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Tulsa Imperative**: back after 194 archived shows (2841 days); rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Bell Swamp Connection**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2024-08-09** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 19 songs; 100 min [1]. Said about its sound: The recording includes banter, piano transitions, and water tower mini-introductions between songs [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: No Children, banter - duo transition & JD amusing himself with an [1]\n- Peter Hughes missed the show due to COVID, with Ben filling in on bass [1]\n- Field Medic served as the supporting act for the Mountain Goats on this tour [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2024-08-09**: taped by LMGBTapes; transferred by LMGBTapes; source: CA-14 omnis > CA-Ugly 2 preamp > Sony PCM-10 (on stage, healy) + SBD [Engineer: Brandon Eggleston] > Sony PCM-A10 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by panetory.com: [The Mountain Goats The Mill & Mine Knoxville Tn Aug 9 2024 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/the-mountain-goats-the-mill-mine-knoxville-tn-aug-9-2024-poster) [3]",
